WEBVTT

00:19.740 --> 00:23.740
both: I heart the circus!
两人：我喜欢马戏团！

00:26.906 --> 00:30.406
- Children of all ages!
- 所有年龄段的孩子！

00:30.473 --> 00:35.240
Get ready to wet
your baggy pants laughing!
准备好淋湿
你的宽松裤子在笑！

00:35.306 --> 00:38.740
Send in the clowns!
派小丑来！

00:38.806 --> 00:39.773
He-yah!
嘿-呀！

00:51.973 --> 00:54.606
Our candy-corn-fed clowns
我们以糖果玉米喂养的小丑

00:54.740 --> 00:58.773
once roamed
the slapstick plains
曾经漫游过
闹剧平原

00:58.840 --> 01:02.773
where wild clowns run free!
狂野的小丑在那里自由奔跑！

01:02.840 --> 01:04.773
* *
**
**
**

01:04.840 --> 01:05.873
He-yah!
嘿-呀！

01:05.940 --> 01:07.473
He-yah!
嘿-呀！

01:07.540 --> 01:09.106
He-yah!
嘿-呀！

01:09.173 --> 01:10.106
He-yah!
嘿-呀！

01:10.173 --> 01:12.240
* *
**
**
**

01:12.306 --> 01:13.573
He-yah!
嘿-呀！

01:13.640 --> 01:16.306
[donkey brays,
balloon swells, pops]
[驴叫声，
气球膨胀，爆裂]

01:17.906 --> 01:21.740
- Look, there's those!
- 看，就是那些！

01:21.740 --> 01:23.106
- Oh.
- 哦。

01:23.173 --> 01:25.640
Are you hungry, little clown?
小小丑，你饿了吗？

01:28.373 --> 01:30.140
- He-yah!
- 嘿啊！

01:30.206 --> 01:33.206
Don't feed the clowns!
不要喂小丑！

01:35.040 --> 01:36.906
SpongeBob, are you mad?
海绵宝宝，你生气了吗？

01:36.973 --> 01:39.306
Clowns are dangerous animals.
小丑是危险的动物。

01:39.373 --> 01:42.306
Why, at any moment,
one of those things
为什么，在任何时候，
其中之一

01:42.373 --> 01:44.773
could get loose
and bite our feet off!
可能会松动
并咬掉我们的脚！

01:46.406 --> 01:48.740
- Oh, Patrick, that little
clown wouldn't do that.
- 哦，帕特里克，那个小
小丑不会这么做。

01:48.740 --> 01:50.273
He was friendly.
他很友善。

01:54.740 --> 01:57.806
* *
**
**
**

02:07.240 --> 02:11.740
* *
**
**
**

02:15.106 --> 02:17.440
I wanna go backstage
and see the clowns, Patrick.
我想去后台
看看小丑，帕特里克。

02:17.506 --> 02:21.040
- I told you, SpongeBob,
our feet are in danger!
- 我告诉过你了，海绵宝宝，
我们的脚有危险！

02:21.106 --> 02:24.806
- I'll protect you.
- 我会保护你。

02:24.873 --> 02:26.173
Ooh.
哦。

02:26.240 --> 02:31.340
* *
**
**
**

02:33.640 --> 02:34.740
clowns: Huh?
小丑：啊？

02:39.073 --> 02:40.840
- Poor little guy.
- 可怜的小家伙。

02:56.006 --> 02:58.040
- Hey, he didn't get any food.
- 嘿，他没有得到任何食物。

02:58.106 --> 02:59.606
Hmm.
唔。

03:01.273 --> 03:02.373
- Hey, psst!
- 嘿，嘘！

03:02.440 --> 03:04.206
Huh?
啊？

03:05.773 --> 03:08.973
- Don't feed the clowns!
- 不要喂小丑！

03:10.140 --> 03:12.073
- My feet!
- 我的脚！

03:12.140 --> 03:13.473
- Pack it up, everyone.
- 收拾好，大家。

03:13.540 --> 03:14.740
He-yah!
嘿-呀！

03:19.940 --> 03:25.040
* *
**
**
**

03:35.773 --> 03:38.440
- I don't care what that mean
old ringmaster says.
- 我不在乎这意味着什么
老领班说道。

03:38.506 --> 03:42.006
That clown is hungry, and I'm
gonna feed him.
那个小丑饿了，而我
会喂他。

03:43.740 --> 03:45.540
Hey, where'd the circus go?
嘿，马戏团去哪儿了？

03:45.606 --> 03:47.940
Now I'll never find that little
clown.
现在我再也找不到那个小东西了
小丑。

03:54.873 --> 03:56.206
There you are.
你就在那里。

03:57.540 --> 03:58.540
- Hey, little clown.
- 嘿，小小丑。

03:58.606 --> 04:00.140
The circus left without you!
马戏团离开了你！

04:00.206 --> 04:02.573
Quick, we gotta get you back to
your clown friends.
快点，我们得送你回去
你的小丑朋友。

04:03.906 --> 04:07.073
Oh, you don't want to go
back to the circus?
哦，你不想走
回到马戏团？

04:09.040 --> 04:11.206
- You don't want to be
a circus clown?
- 你不想成为
马戏团小丑？

04:16.373 --> 04:17.840
- You know, little clown,
I don't blame you.
- 你知道，小小丑，
我不怪你。

04:17.906 --> 04:19.306
You shouldn't stay in a place
where they
你不应该呆在一个地方
他们在哪里

04:19.373 --> 04:20.840
push you around
all the time.
把你推来推去
一直。

04:20.906 --> 04:23.873
Looks like I'll have to help
you find a new job.
看来我得帮忙
你找到了一份新工作。

04:23.940 --> 04:25.106
But what else can you do?
但你还能做什么呢？

04:31.740 --> 04:33.773
- This job should be a snap,
little clown.
- 这项工作应该是轻而易举的，
小小丑。

04:33.840 --> 04:35.073
Watch me.
看着我。

04:35.140 --> 04:37.806
* Pick up the hot dog,
put it in a bun *
*拿起热狗，
把它放进包子里*

04:37.873 --> 04:40.140
* Add the mustard, relish,
now you're having fun *
*加入芥末，调味，
现在你玩得很开心*

04:41.940 --> 04:43.440
- Oh-ho-ho, hotdog!
- 哦嗬嗬，热狗！

04:43.506 --> 04:44.806
Look at that.
看看那个。

04:44.873 --> 04:46.006
Looks like fun!
看起来很有趣！

04:46.073 --> 04:48.406
- Okay, you're on.
- 好吧，你开始了。

04:50.240 --> 04:53.740
[hotdogs hissing,
clown screams]
[热狗嘶嘶作响，
小丑尖叫]

05:04.773 --> 05:07.006
My wieners!
我的维也纳人！

05:10.173 --> 05:12.206
Sorry.
对不起。

05:17.306 --> 05:18.840
I think you'll get a job
a lot quicker
我想你会找到工作的
快很多

05:18.906 --> 05:21.040
if we tone down the whole
clown thing a smidge.
如果我们调低整体
小丑的事有点。

05:21.106 --> 05:22.873
Don't worry.
When I get through with you,
不用担心。
当我和你相处的时候

05:22.940 --> 05:25.273
your own ringmaster
won't recognize you.
你自己的领班
不会认出你的。

05:36.340 --> 05:37.606
Ahh!
啊！

05:47.140 --> 05:49.940
- "Businessmen wanted."
——《商人通缉》。

05:50.006 --> 05:51.406
Go get 'em, little clown.
去抓住他们吧，小小丑。

05:51.473 --> 05:54.406
Oh, I mean, Mr. little clown.
哦，我是说，小小丑先生。

06:02.106 --> 06:04.406
- Here's your stool.
Here's your stamper.
- 这是你的凳子。
这是你的印章。

06:04.473 --> 06:06.273
Now get to work.
现在开始工作吧。

06:10.873 --> 06:14.240
- Aww.
- 哇。

06:40.373 --> 06:43.573
Who hired this clown?
谁雇了这个小丑？

06:43.640 --> 06:45.506
- Um, you did, sir.
- 嗯，你做到了，先生。

06:48.206 --> 06:50.440
Fired!
被解雇了！

06:58.373 --> 06:59.640
What happened, little clown?
发生什么事了，小小丑？

06:59.740 --> 07:01.040
Didn't you like that job?
你不喜欢那份工作吗？

07:04.373 --> 07:05.306
- Hmm.
- 唔。

07:05.373 --> 07:07.573
Ooh!
哦！

07:07.640 --> 07:09.940
Maybe a career in firefighting.
也许从事消防工作。

07:13.773 --> 07:15.573
- Have a nice fire!
- 祝你生火愉快！

07:18.940 --> 07:21.073
I'll just make sure he gets
there safely.
我会确保他得到
安全地在那里。

07:32.340 --> 07:33.740
Whoa, whoa, whoa, whoa, whoa.
哇，哇，哇，哇，哇。

07:33.773 --> 07:36.406
Not Mrs. Puff's Boating School!
不是帕夫夫人的划船学校！

07:36.473 --> 07:38.306
- Save me!
Save me!
- 救救我！
救救我吧！

07:38.373 --> 07:40.273
I'm too young to broil!
我太年轻了，不能烤！

07:53.540 --> 07:56.540
You're fired!
你被解雇了！

07:58.773 --> 08:00.106
- This is it, little clown.
- 就是这样，小小丑。

08:00.173 --> 08:03.006
The last job available in
Bikini Bottom.
最后一个职位是在
比基尼下装。

08:04.540 --> 08:06.540
- If you can just stop
the clowning for two minutes,
- 如果你能停下来
两分钟的小丑表演，

08:06.606 --> 08:07.840
you'll have a job.
你会有一份工作。

08:07.906 --> 08:09.140
Please!
请！

08:09.206 --> 08:10.640
Sorry, little clown.
It's been a long day.
对不起，小小丑。
这是漫长的一天。

08:11.740 --> 08:13.173
Good luck.
祝你好运。

08:20.973 --> 08:22.306
Hmm.
唔。

08:22.373 --> 08:23.906
Hmm.
Aha!
唔。
啊哈！

08:24.940 --> 08:25.973
Now get in there, eyes,
现在进入那里，眼睛，

08:26.040 --> 08:28.140
and stay close to that clown.
并靠近那个小丑。

08:29.706 --> 08:32.140
- Your job
is to pack up the pies!
- 你的工作
就是收拾馅饼！

08:33.373 --> 08:34.706
- Hmm!
- 唔！

08:55.673 --> 09:02.340
- No! No, little clown!
No!
- 不！不，小小丑！
不！

09:02.406 --> 09:04.473
No!
不！

09:06.773 --> 09:08.540
Phew!
唷！

09:23.073 --> 09:24.006
- Lemon pie!
- 柠檬派！

09:28.740 --> 09:30.373
- Mmm!
- 嗯！

09:38.240 --> 09:39.440
- Eye pie!
- 眼睛馅饼！

09:45.740 --> 09:47.440
You...
你...

09:47.506 --> 09:49.406
Are...
是...

09:56.206 --> 09:57.240
Au revoir!
再见！

10:05.740 --> 10:08.740
I didn't order a pie.
我没有点馅饼。

10:11.906 --> 10:14.406
- Oh, little clown,
I'm so sorry.
- 哦，小小丑，
我很抱歉。

10:14.473 --> 10:18.606
I thought you needed a day job,
but you're a clown.
我以为你需要一份日常工作
但你是个小丑。

10:18.740 --> 10:22.940
And a clown needs to run free.
小丑需要自由奔跑。

10:30.040 --> 10:33.273
[clowns laughing
and chattering]
[小丑笑
和喋喋不休]

10:48.740 --> 10:50.406
- Aww.
- 哇。

10:54.006 --> 10:55.340
- Aww.
- 哇。

- 哇。